==Galician==

===Etymology===
Perhaps from {{der|gl|de|Gott|bei Gott|by God}}, because, when taking an [[oath]], some men, once they said "by God", aimed at the superior lip with the [[index finger]], [[symbolising]] forming the [[cross]] with the fingers and kissing it. Compare {{cog|pt|bigode}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/bi.ˈɣɔ.tɪ/|lang=gl}}
* {{audio|Gl-bigote.ogg|Audio|lang=gl}}

===Noun===
{{gl-noun|m}}

# [[moustache]], [[mustache]]; [[moustaches]], [[mustaches]]
# [[whisker]], [[whiskers]]

====Usage notes====
May be used in the singular or plural with the same meaning, as in English.

